Task 6. Create a metrics-based alert
From the left side menu for Logging, click on Log-based Metrics under Configure.

In user-defined metrics, click on More actions (more actions icon) for hello-app-error, and select Create alert from metric.

Under Select a Metric, the metric parameters will automatically fill in.
